
# The remnants of the marketing site this application used to carry: a home
# page, an about page and a services page, the header and footer they share, and
# the SEO component that stamped meta tags onto them. Upstream has already
# unwired all seven — nothing routes to them and nothing imports them, which is
# why they are merely dead rather than a second website. They are removed so
# they cannot be relinked later, and so the next person reading this repository
# does not find a plausible-looking home page for the module and take it for
# the intended entry point.
#
# components/pdf/Footer is a different file and is used by the report and invoice
# PDFs. It is not listed here and must not be.
resources/js/Home.jsx
resources/js/About.jsx
resources/js/Services.jsx
resources/js/Footer.jsx
resources/js/Navbar.jsx
resources/js/Navbar.css
resources/js/components/SEO.jsx
